--- !u!114 &1975222031
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1975222027}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5902fd7a887f3454dba9091bde4f4eef, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: PaintedAlive.Runtime::PaintedAlive.Environment.LivingGallery.LivingGalleryGapClosureState
  sourceManifestSchema: painted_alive.living_gallery.unity_handoff.v1
  sourceManifestSha256: dca59e0ae771c5dfb297ce74aafbf6cdf3e43b00312afbee68742ba00520079a
  resolutions:
  - gapId: VISIBILITY_PORTALS
    kind: 0
    resolved: 1
    note: Existing four HIDDEN occupancy volumes remain authoritative; Unity-only
      opening triggers now force overlap-safe occupancy refresh at authored portals/connected
      thresholds.
  - gapId: THRESHOLD_VOLUMES
    kind: 1
    resolved: 1
    note: Two HIDDEN threshold volumes are derived from the exact authored opaque
      roof + walkable bridge bounds. Thin roof colliders are not reused as presence
      triggers.
  - gapId: INK_DETECTION
    kind: 2
    resolved: 1
    note: Figure presence is detected from existing FigureMotor world position inside
      the authored 10.5-14.5m ink ring; decoy location/orientation is derived only
      from authority-safe event seed and authored reflection zones.
  - gapId: GATE_ENDPOINT_TRANSFORMS
    kind: 3
    resolved: 1
    note: Unity-only 0/90 degree endpoint references are created from each neutral
      pivot basis and handoff-listed nearby route transforms are bound directly.
  - gapId: PIGMENT_EFFECTS
    kind: 4
    resolved: 1
    note: No target/effect pair exists in the source, so all three PigmentRouteModifier
      instances are explicitly None/unconfigured. Visual source-to-destination flow
      remains active; no colour-based gameplay inference is made.
  - gapId: PAPER_COLLISION_STATES
    kind: 5
    resolved: 1
    note: The dedicated low-resolution BASIS proxy is cloned at runtime. DRY preserves
      BASIS; WET adds the authored 0.14m/0.10m centre sag and the coarse proxy interpolates
      with the visual state.
  - gapId: CANVAS_SWING_SETUP
    kind: 6
    resolved: 1
    note: Both authored moving canvases use the handoff-proposed top-bar local-X
      swing, max 10 degrees, 25 deg/s. Wash overlays + their straps follow their
      own pivots; fixed hangers remain stationary and no hard collider is added.
  - gapId: FALL_SPAWN_RESPAWN
    kind: 7
    resolved: 1
    note: A fall volume is derived below the lowest actual walkable collision proxy,
      not visual height. Respawn uses the authored ENTRY as an explicitly Unity-authored
      provisional point and FigureMotor.Teleport/ResetMotion as the existing local
      character authority.
  - gapId: REGION_DESTINATION
    kind: 8
    resolved: 1
    note: ENTRY is explicitly Prismatic Reach incoming context. EXIT is the end of
      the currently implemented journey and remains owned by the existing journey/match
      exit; no fictional next-region ID is invented.
